        "id": 261830,
        "name": "",
        "username": "fjur",
        "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/fjur/{size}/4849_2.png",
        "created_at": "2024-12-19T17:56:07.042Z",
        "cooked": "<p>Yeah, damage doesn’t count as a penalty. And by the same token, FWIW the results of Boost actions and all other positive mods are called <em>bonuses</em> (but other helpful status effects like the results of Defend actions aren’t), in case you may get tripped up by that.</p>\n<p>And even with the basic version of the ability without the extra Red zone effect, you could use it to Hinder one target while Attacking another, as otherwise the ability would tell you to Attack the <em>same</em> target.</p>",
        "post_number": 4,
        "post_type": 1,
        "updated_at": "2024-12-19T17:56:07.042Z",
        "reply_count": 1,
        "reply_to_post_number": null,
